}\log p(z_t)$ and epsilon $\boldsymbol{\epsilon}_\theta(z_t)$ are equivalent. Then, given that $p_{\theta}(z_{t}|c)p_{\theta}(c|z_{t})^{\gamma} \propto p_{\theta}(z_{t})p_{\theta}(c|z_{t})^{\gamma+1}$<|CIT-MASK|>, we can formulate classifier guidance as follows:
